# ─── Environment Variables ───────────────────────────────────────
# DO NOT put real secrets here. This is a template only.
#
# SETUP: Symlink to the master secrets file:
#   ln -sf ~/.env.secrets .env
#
# The master secrets file lives at ~/.env.secrets
# Edit THAT file to update credentials for ALL repos at once.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

